{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2022-09-20 14:24:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN TO UNVEIL THE B-21 RAIDER', 'text': "FALLS CHURCH, VA., SEPT. 20, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC), IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THE U.S. AIR FORCE, WILL UNVEIL THE B-21 RAIDER DURING THE FIRST WEEK OF DECEMBER AT THE COMPANY'S PALMDALE, CALIFORNIA FACILITY."}